{
  "name": "validate-parallel-structure",
  "format": 2,
  "kind": "validate",
  "description": "A parallel's branches end in its join or an end: a branch that leads back into the parallel is refused at its edge (and, waiting nowhere, is also a cycle without wait), and a node of the branches that is also entered from outside them (after the join) at the node.",
